        "dosageInstruction": [
          {
            "text": "Take 2 mg orally as needed for loose stool or urgency; start 30–60 minutes before times when toilet access is limited, such as a commute or teaching block. May repeat up to four times daily; maximum 8 mg in 24 hours. Aim for formed, not hard, stool. Stop if no bowel movement for more than 48 hours or significant crampy pain or bloating. Do not use if PR blood, fever, or suspected acute flare without medical review.",
